# CI and Deploy

## Existing gates
- CI: format, lint, OpenAPI, Prisma generate, build, unit tests
- CD: Infisical export → migrate → compose/k3s → smoke health

## Rules
- Prefer `--frozen-lockfile` style installs in CI
- Keep `scripts/docker/workloads.manifest.json` as source of truth; regenerate compose/k3s (`pnpm docker:prod:generate`, `pnpm k3s:generate`)
- Do not silently ignore image pull / login failures in deploy scripts
- Pin deploy to the release commit/tag being shipped — avoid always deploying floating `main` for production tags
- After deploy: run smoke (`scripts/deploy/smoke-health.sh`) before declaring success
- Add security scanning when touching CI (dependency audit, image scan) — currently absent; do not remove Dependabot
- Never weaken SSH/host hardening scripts without an explicit security review note
